# Local-only settings. These hold real credentials - an SMTP password among them - and
# `dotnet publish` would otherwise copy them straight into the image, where anybody who
# pulls it can read them.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
LICENSE
README.md

# The Angular application. This file governs only the three .NET builds, which all
# use src/ as their context and never need a single file from UI/. The UI image
# builds from its own context (UI/YDots.UI) under its own .dockerignore, so it is
# unaffected by this line.
#
# Without it every "docker compose build ydots-don-api" uploads ~283 MB of Angular
# source, dist output and .angular cache to the daemon before the build starts.
UI/

# Stray artefacts at the context root: a 4 MB bundle and an exported swagger
# document. Neither is referenced by any .csproj.
c.js
swagger.json

!**/.gitignore
!.git/HEAD
!.git/config
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/heads/**